<h2>Article 1 — Purpose</h2>
<p>These terms of use set out the conditions for accessing and using the website <a href="https://www.gfi-co.net/">https://www.gfi-co.net/</a>, published by GFI-CO SARL. The purpose of the website is in particular to present the company, its activities, services and real estate projects, and to enable visitors to request information or contact the company. These terms apply to any person consulting the website or using its features.</p>

<h2>Article 2 — Acceptance of the terms</h2>
<p>By accessing the website, users acknowledge that they have read these terms of use. Users undertake to use the website in accordance with these terms and with the legislation applicable in Côte d'Ivoire. Where a particular service is subject to specific terms, those terms apply in addition to these Terms of Use.</p>

<h2>Article 3 — Access to the website</h2>
<p>The website is freely accessible to any user with computer or mobile equipment and an internet connection. Internet access and equipment costs remain the responsibility of the user. GFI-CO SARL strives to ensure the accessibility of the website. However, it may temporarily suspend access, in particular for maintenance, updates, security operations or due to circumstances beyond its control. The company does not guarantee permanent or uninterrupted availability of the website.</p>

<h2>Article 4 — Real estate information and offers</h2>
<p>The information published on the website is intended to present the activities, properties, projects and services of GFI-CO SARL. It is provided for information purposes only, unless expressly stated otherwise. The characteristics of a property or project, including its location, surface area, price, status, availability, facilities and acquisition conditions, must be confirmed with the company.</p>
<p>Photographs, illustrations, plans, perspectives and visual representations may be illustrative only. They do not replace the applicable technical, administrative or contractual documents. The information displayed on the website does not, in itself, constitute: a firm contractual offer; a promise of sale; a property reservation; a guarantee of availability; or a guarantee of profitability or real estate appreciation. Any commitment relating to a real estate transaction must be formalised in the appropriate documents, in accordance with applicable legislation.</p>

<h2>Article 5 — Information requests and forms</h2>
<p>The website may allow users to contact GFI-CO SARL by means of a contact form or an information or quote request. Users undertake to provide accurate, up-to-date and relevant information for the processing of their request. They undertake in particular not to transmit misleading or unlawful information or information infringing the rights of third parties.</p>
<p>Submitting a form does not automatically constitute an order, a reservation, acceptance of a quote or the conclusion of a contract. GFI-CO SARL reviews the requests received and responds to them as far as possible, depending on their nature and the information provided.</p>

<h2>Article 6 — Contact via WhatsApp</h2>
<p>The website may provide a link allowing users to open a conversation with GFI-CO SARL on WhatsApp. Use of this link is optional. Users may also contact the company through the other means of communication made available to them. When users continue browsing on WhatsApp, they use a third-party service subject to its provider's terms and privacy rules. Exchanges on this platform do not replace the official contractual documents that may be required for a real estate transaction.</p>

<h2>Article 7 — Mapping and location</h2>
<p>The website may include a map based on the OpenStreetMap service to facilitate consultation of the location of the company or certain places. Mapping information is provided for guidance only. Users must verify the information required for their travel or project with the appropriate sources. The representation of a place on a map does not constitute proof of ownership, cadastral delimitation, land availability or administrative compliance of a plot of land.</p>

